{"id":"n2-124","title":"～に応えて","romaji":"〜ni kotaete","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Responding to; living up to; meeting.","longExplanation":"The ～に応えて grammar point is used to express an action in response to something (an expectation, request, or situation). It can be translated as 'responding to', 'living up to', or 'meeting' in English. This grammar point is generally used with nouns or noun phrases.","formation":"Noun + に応えて","examples":[{"jp":"お客様の要望に応えて、新しいメニューを作りました。","romaji":"Okyaku-sama no youbou ni kotaete, atarashii menyuu o tsukurimashita.","en":"Responding to the customers' requests, we created a new menu.","words":[{"surface":"お客様","vocabId":"1001770","reading":"おきゃくさま"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"要望","vocabId":"1546830","reading":"ようぼう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"応え","vocabId":"2852531","reading":"いらえ","baseForm":"応える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"メニュー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作り","vocabId":"1297250","reading":"つくり","baseForm":"作る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼はチームの期待に応えて素晴らしいプレーを見せた。","romaji":"Kare wa chiimu no kitai ni kotaete, subarashii puree o miseta.","en":"He lived up to the team's expectations and showed a great performance.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"チーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"期待","vocabId":"1220570","reading":"きたい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"応え","vocabId":"2852531","reading":"いらえ","baseForm":"応える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"素晴らしい","vocabId":"1397300","reading":"すばらしい"},{"surface":"プレー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見せ","vocabId":"1259210","reading":"みせる","baseForm":"見せる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"政府は国民の声に応えて、新しい法律を制定した。","romaji":"Seifu wa kokumin no koe ni kotaete, atarashii houritsu o seitei shita.","en":"The government enacted a new law in response to the voice of the people.","words":[{"surface":"政府","vocabId":"1376070","reading":"せいふ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"国民","vocabId":"1287070","reading":"こくみん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"声","vocabId":"1380440","reading":"こえ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"応え","vocabId":"2852531","reading":"いらえ","baseForm":"応える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"法律","vocabId":"1517480","reading":"ほうりつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"制定","vocabId":"1374870","reading":"せいてい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"企業は環境問題に応えて、環境に優しい製品を開発している。","romaji":"Kigyou wa kankyou mondai ni kotaete, kankyou ni yasashii seihin o kaihatsu shite iru.","en":"Companies are developing environmentally friendly products in response to environmental issues.","words":[{"surface":"企業","vocabId":"1218190","reading":"きぎょう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"環境","vocabId":"1213280","reading":"かんきょう"},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"応え","vocabId":"2852531","reading":"いらえ","baseForm":"応える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"環境","vocabId":"1213280","reading":"かんきょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"優しい","vocabId":"1539040","reading":"やさしい"},{"surface":"製品","vocabId":"1380760","reading":"せいひん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"開発","vocabId":"1202880","reading":"かいはつ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]}]}